## Integration Testing Checklist

### Infrastructure Setup
- [ ] Orleans cluster configured and running via `ClusterFixture`
- [ ] MongoDB in-memory database initialized
- [ ] All required services registered in test module
- [ ] Test data seeder implemented and configured
- [ ] Integration test base class created with system builders

### Test Module Structure
- [ ] Create module-specific `TestModule` class inheriting from `AbpModule`
